    "gp_section_610325512484553516": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "ea5f91ca13f78f6a4e203cf3efc9f471b871a11b4d665771d8db8eb705e15fb5_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg6KCjI5kR7_text": "<p>Then we don’t want your money. Use the entire pouch (or even empty it) and email us within 90 days. We’ll refund every penny — no questions, no restocking fees, and we even cover return shipping. Over 12,847 customers have trusted this promise</p>",
        "gg7jmTRUEzD_text": "<p>Every single batch is tested by an ISO 17025 accredited lab after cooking. We publish the <a href=\"#g3wTy8wfqJ\"><u>full COA right here</u></a>. No other gummy brand shows you post-cooking results. That’s why 8 of the top 10 Amazon brands failed independent tests — we refused to play that game</p>",
        "ggD-NsRVdUC_text": "<p>Most people notice better workouts and mental clarity in 7–14 days. Full strength and recovery benefits hit around week 3–4. That’s exactly why we recommend the 2-pouch Performance Pack — it gives you a full 60-day trial so you can feel the difference risk-free.</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_0": "<p>Was unterscheidet FusiForce von anderen Kreatin-Gummies?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_1": "<p>Können Frauen FusiForce Creatine Gummies einnehmen?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_2": "<p>Wird FusiForce unabhängig getestet und auf Reinheit überprüft?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_3": "<p>Warum Portionsbeutel?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_4": "<p>Wie lange dauert es, bis ich Ergebnisse sehe?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_5": "<p>Was, wenn es bei mir nicht wirkt?</p>",
        "ggEjvfvLgz-_childItem_6": "<p>Kann FusiForce Blähungen oder Magenprobleme verursachen?</p>",
        "ggIQr6cuOI4_childItem_0": "<p>GRATIS Versand ab 65 €</p>",
        "ggIjn8cneWS_childItem_0": "<p>Über 137.235 zufriedene Kunden</p>",
        "ggK27PSUNQ0_text": "<p>While other brands test their powder before cooking (then destroy the creatine with heat), we test the finished gummies after cooking — and publish the lab reports. Our founder spent 10 months perfecting every detail, personally audited 50+ manufacturers, and is the only one willing to take full accountability. Result? 5,000 mg of real, verified creatine in just 3 gummies. Most customers who switched from Amazon brands say it’s the first time they actually felt the difference</p>",
        "ggMBH7oYco4_childItem_0": "<p>Kundenservice rund um die Uhr</p>",
        "ggUHrOh1j9E_text": "<p>Es hat uns 2 Jahre gekostet, das Schmelzproblem zu lösen. Jede 3-Gummy-Portion ist vorportioniert und geschützt. Wirf sie ohne Behälter in deine Sporttasche. Kein klebriges Chaos.</p>",
        "ggUWlKQpi93_text": "<p>Nein. Da wir reines Kreatin-Monohydrat verwenden (keine billigen Füllstoffe) und jede Charge nach der Herstellung testen, sind Blähungen extrem selten. Die kleine 3-Gummy-Portion + Panax Ginseng unterstützt die Verdauung bei den meisten sogar. Wenn du dich in den ersten 90 Tagen unwohl fühlst, erstatten wir dir sofort den Kaufpreis.</p>",
        "ggdcoTbazk6_text": "<p>FusiForce ist das erste saubere Kreatin-Gummy, das wirklich wirkt.</p>",
        "gghICwHbGvV_label": "<p>TESTE FUSIFORCE NOCH HEUTE!</p>",
        "ggiq7zJ_fAj_childItem_0": "<p>90-Tage-Geld-zurück-Garantie</p>",
        "ggkniwjg1Fr_text": "<strong>Noch </strong><span style=\"background-color:rgba(189,229,34,0.77);\"><i><strong>Fragen?</strong></i></span>",
        "ggzyMOMHA9n_text": "<p>Yes — 100% safe for women. Many of our customers in perimenopause or menopause use it daily for mental clarity, energy, and recovery (not just muscle). The clinical 5g dose works the same for everyone. Start with 3 gummies per day — you’ll feel sharper within 2–3 weeks</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-610325512484553516"
    },
